            "review_text": "Stay10321746710\n1 contribution\n0\nExperience at Bac Kim Thang steaming restaurant\nApr 2024 • Friends\nThe restaurant space is airy, the staff is friendly and enthusiastic, the dishes are fresh, delicious and unique ♡\nThis is a restaurant worth experiencing 🫶🏻\nShow original\nWritten May 23, 2024\nBắc Kim Thang Vietnamese Steam House\nCảm ơn bạn đã lựa chọn dịch vụ và ủng hộ nhà hàng chúng tôi. Chúng tôi thật may mắn khi có bạn là khách hàng. Hi vọng bạn vẫn tiếp tục đồng hành cùng chúng tôi trong tương lai. Xin chân thành cảm ơn 🤗\n________________________________\n\nThank you, we're very happy to see this great rating. We appreciate your support. Hope to see you again at our restaurant. Cheers\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
